## The Most Likely Cause\
The most likely reason for both the missing memory logs and the 404 error is that the application is crashing on startup because the psutil library is not installed in the live container.\
\
When you add a new library to requirements.txt, simply pushing the code is not enough. The container itself must be rebuilt to install that new dependency. If it's not rebuilt, the application starts, immediately hits import psutil, fails with an ImportError, and shuts down. This causes the 404 error on all URLs and prevents any logs from being generated.\
