## The Problem: A Missing Comma\
The traceback points directly to the issue in your /app/app/rag_components/agent_setup.py file.\
\
SyntaxError: invalid syntax on line 44: sample_rows_in_table_info=False\
\
This happens because when you added the new line to the SQLDatabase.from_uri() function, the line before it was missing a comma (,) to separate the arguments.\
\
## The Fix \uc0\u55357 \u56481 \
You just need to add a single comma.\
\
Your Current (Incorrect) Code likely looks like this:\
Python\
\
db = SQLDatabase.from_uri(\
    db_uri, \
    include_tables=['vessels', 'voyages', 'crew', 'maintenance'] # <--- MISSING COMMA HERE\
    sample_rows_in_table_info=False\
)\
The Corrected Code should look like this:\
Python\
\
db = SQLDatabase.from_uri(\
    db_uri, \
    include_tables=['vessels', 'voyages', 'crew', 'maintenance'], # <--- ADD THIS COMMA\
    sample_rows_in_table_info=False\
)\
Please make this one-character change to your agent_setup.py file, save it, and then commit and push it to Hugging Face. This should resolve the startup crash for good.\
